  "corpusAnswer": "",
  "explanation": "<div><i>{kirei na}</i>&nbsp;neko&nbsp;<i>綺麗な</i>猫</div><div><i>{shaberu}</i>&nbsp;neko&nbsp;<i>しゃべる</i>猫</div>",
  "explanationLong": "<div><div>one of the six basic inflectable forms of verbs and adjectives.<br></div></div><div><hr></div><div><i>almost identical to the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.japanesewithanime.com/2019/12/shuushikei.html?m=1\">shuushikei&nbsp;終止形</a>.</i> Except:<br><br><b>For&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.japanesewithanime.com/2018/11/na-adjectives.html?m=1\"><i>na-</i>adjectives</a>, the&nbsp;<i>rentaikei</i>&nbsp;is composed by the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.japanesewithanime.com/2019/10/na-copula.html?m=1\">attributive copula&nbsp;<i>na</i>&nbsp;な</a>, while the&nbsp;<i>shuushikei</i>&nbsp;is composed by the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.japanesewithanime.com/2019/10/da-copula.html?m=1\">predicative copula&nbsp;<i>da</i>&nbsp;だ</a>.</b></div><div><div><hr><i></i></div></div>",
